#html.h2(id: "research")[Research]

- *ConcordOS.* I designed how an agent turns observations into a reviewed plan before it acts in a Linux sandbox.
- *Pero Agent Lab.* I built a planner and executor that connect literature searches with the design and screening of perovskite materials.
- *SEU Agent Town.* I built a campus simulation where agents exchange messages and recall encounters across multiple days.
- *Ophthalmic OCT.* I evaluated how well models trained to segment eye scans generalize across datasets.

